 (exp4271 +0.4038 held-out) but on ONE substrate (the recovered 52-task
 manifest), inviting the 'specific to your partition' critique. ARC-GEN
 (arXiv:2511.00162, github.com/google/ARC-GEN) is Google's mimetic procedural
 generator faithfully covering ALL 400 ARC-AGI-1 + 500 ARC-AGI-2 tasks, each a
 parameterized generator with a NATIVE family id -- an INDEPENDENT family
 substrate. Clone it (GITIGNORED -- no embedded-repo gitlink), build a
 family-disjoint candidate pool with native family ids + exact target hashes,
 train the set-encoder on train-families, test beats-vote on HELD-OUT
 generator-families. Report cross_family_delta SEPARATELY on original-ARC /
 ARC-TGI / ARC-GEN families (the generators-become-their-own-distribution
 failure mode) + a randomized family-rich stress split (arXiv:2601.18217).
 Emit arcgen_cross_family_holds BARE bool := (held-out-family delta>0 AND
 CI95-excl-0 on the ARC-GEN families). verifier_is_oracle=false. HARD-CAP to
 the window; an honest partial pool (>=4 families, >=~10 held-out tasks/fold)
 is fine.

